<title>ITALY: SOCCER-TORINO DISMISS COACH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TORINO DISMISS COACH.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Torino coach Mauro Sandreani was sacked on Monday after a third straight home defeat.</p>
<p>The club said Sandreani, who joined this season, would be replaced by goalkeeping coach Lido Vieri in what appeared to be a stop-gap appointment.</p>
<p>Torino slumped 2-1 at home to Padova on Sunday and occupy sixth placed in the Italian second division.</p>
</text>
